<title>BELARUS: Belarus '96 trade deficit up to $1.7 bln.</title>
<headline>Belarus '96 trade deficit up to $1.7 bln.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belarus's trade deficit widened to $1,654.7 million in 1996 from $856.8 million in 1995, the Statistics Ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>  BELARUS MERCHANDISE TRADE   Jan-Dec 96  Jan-Nov 96  Jan-Dec 95</p>
<p>  imports	  ($ million)	6,918.9     6,219.8     5,563.6</p>
<p>  exports			   5,264.2     4,832.5     4,706.8</p>
<p>  trade balance		  -1,654.7    -1,387.3	-856.8</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
